{"step_index":272,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T13:58:46Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 1 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. MASTER SUPER PROMPT — HOUSEHOLD MANAGEMENT APPLICATION\r\n\r\nAct as a Senior Full-Stack Application Developer, Senior UI/UX Designer, Product Designer, Software Architect, AI Engineer, Security Engineer, QA Engineer, and DevOps Engineer.\r\n\r\nBuild the complete Household Management Application described below as a professional, production-ready, fully demonstrable application.\r\n\r\nThe application must not be treated as a university/student project, basic CRUD project, mockup, prototype, or visual-only demonstration.\r\n\r\nEvery feature that is implemented must actually work.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. PRODUCTION-READY & FULLY DEMONSTRABLE — NON-NEGOTIABLE\r\n\r\nThese requirements apply to the entire application.\r\n\r\nFull Functionality\r\n\r\nEvery:\r\n\r\n- Feature\r\n- Button\r\n- Form\r\n- Page\r\n- Navigation item\r\n- AI feature\r\n- Notification\r\n- Calculation\r\n- Visualization\r\n- CRUD operation\r\n- Authentication flow\r\n- User interaction\r\n\r\nthat exists in the application must be fully functional.\r\n\r\nDo NOT:\r\n\r\n- Add buttons that do nothing.\r\n- \n<truncated 15933 bytes>\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n- **Build Complete Production-Ready Household Management Application** (`STATUS: IMPLEMENTATION`)\n  - **User Intent**: Build a full-stack, production-ready, demonstrable application with persistent database, real authentication, and zero dummy data across 6 core modules:\n    1. Bills & Rent Management (all 13 categories, payment status `Paid`/`Pending`/`Overdue`, 7-tier remin